flows():\n+    \"\"\"显式 len() 仍可抛 OverflowError（与内置 range 一致）。\"\"\"\n+    with pytest.raises(OverflowError):\n+        len(numeric_range(HUGE))\n+    with pytest.raises(OverflowError):\n+        len(range(HUGE))\n"
